{"id":"08ea1622d188e9e9","group":"67","path":"67/67-thm-uniform-conservativity-compression.md","title":"Uniform Single-Sentence Compression","display":"thm-uniform-conservativity-compression — Uniform Single-Sentence Compression","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-thm-uniform-conservativity-compression","aliases":["67-thm-uniform-conservativity-compression"],"display":"thm-uniform-conservativity-compression — Uniform Single-Sentence Compression","depends_on":["[[67-df-partially-conservative]]","[[67-df-arithmetical-classes]]","[[67-df-sentence]]","[[67-df-PA]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li\\[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 10] P (2855)\\[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 1 - libgen.li.pdf","source_edition":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition","source_chapter":5,"source_label":"Theorem 5.4(b)","source_printed_pages":[66],"source_pdf_pages":[77],"verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_status":"source-statement-checked; proof scope and outstanding obligations in Remark","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-thm-uniform-conservativity-compression"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-thm-uniform-conservativity-compression</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-uniform-conservativity-compression — Uniform Single-Sentence Compression"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5d04e3c8a5885c18\" href=\"?note=5d04e3c8a5885c18\" title=\"67-df-partially-conservative\">67-df-partially-conservative</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"851cd80e64893935\" href=\"?note=851cd80e64893935\" title=\"67-df-arithmetical-classes\">67-df-arithmetical-classes</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"854772391cef4007\" href=\"?note=854772391cef4007\" title=\"67-df-sentence\">67-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"cd051851df5d2aa2\" href=\"?note=cd051851df5d2aa2\" title=\"67-df-PA\">67-df-PA</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 10] P (2855)[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 1 - libgen.li.pdf"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"5"},{"key":"source_label","html":"Theorem 5.4(b)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>66</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>77</span></div>"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"source-statement-checked; proof scope and outstanding obligations in Remark"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> 是一致固定 PR 呈示；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge1\">\\(n\\ge1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\Gamma,\\Gamma^{\\mathrm d})\\in\\{(\\Sigma_n,\\Pi_n),(\\Pi_n,\\Sigma_n)\\}\">\\((\\Gamma,\\Gamma^{\\mathrm d})\\in\\{(\\Sigma_n,\\Pi_n),(\\Pi_n,\\Sigma_n)\\}\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"851cd80e64893935\" href=\"?note=851cd80e64893935\" title=\"67-df-arithmetical-classes\">67-df-arithmetical-classes</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\">\\(x,y\\)</span> 为互异变量，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma(x,y)\\in\\Gamma\">\\(\\gamma(x,y)\\in\\Gamma\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{free}_{L_A}(\\gamma)\\subseteq\\{x,y\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{free}_{L_A}(\\gamma)\\subseteq\\{x,y\\}\\)</span>；无捕获代入取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"854772391cef4007\" href=\"?note=854772391cef4007\" title=\"67-df-sentence\">67-df-sentence</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConsSent}\">\\(\\mathrm{ConsSent}\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Conserv}\">\\(\\mathrm{Conserv}\\)</span> 的方向采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5d04e3c8a5885c18\" href=\"?note=5d04e3c8a5885c18\" title=\"67-df-partially-conservative\">67-df-partially-conservative</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar k,\\bar m\">\\(\\bar k,\\bar m\\)</span> 为标准数词，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k,m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k,m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists\\eta\\in\\Gamma\\;\\left(\\mathrm{free}_{L_A}(\\eta)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\mathrm{Conserv}_{\\Gamma^{\\mathrm d}}\\left(T\\cup\\{\\eta[\\bar k/x]\\},T\\cup\\{\\gamma[\\bar k/x,\\bar m/y]:m\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\right)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists\\eta\\in\\Gamma\\;\\left(\\mathrm{free}_{L_A}(\\eta)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\mathrm{Conserv}_{\\Gamma^{\\mathrm d}}\\left(T\\cup\\{\\eta[\\bar k/x]\\},T\\cup\\{\\gamma[\\bar k/x,\\bar m/y]:m\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\right)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应印刷66页/PDF77页定理4(b)，与已有仅压缩一个给定 r.e. 句集的 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"43165f8108fcba25\" href=\"?note=43165f8108fcba25\" title=\"67-thm-conservativity-compression\">67-thm-conservativity-compression</a> 区分。这里存在同一个公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta(x)\">\\(\\eta(x)\\)</span> 同时处理所有行参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span>；不是每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 各自选择一句之后未证明选择可统一。</p>\n<p>原书将(b)的证明留给读者。本轮核对陈述和对(a)及引理2的统一构造依赖，未补全证明；不把来源的定理标签当成笔记内已核验证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-partially-conservative","status":"resolved","id":"5d04e3c8a5885c18","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-partially-conservative]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-arithmetical-classes","status":"resolved","id":"851cd80e64893935","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-arithmetical-classes]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"854772391cef4007","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-PA","status":"resolved","id":"cd051851df5d2aa2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-PA]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-arithmetical-classes","status":"resolved","id":"851cd80e64893935","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}$ 是一致固定 PR 呈示；$n\\ge1$，$(\\Gamma,\\Gamma^{\\mathrm d})\\in\\{(\\Sigma_n,\\Pi_n),(\\Pi_n,\\Sigma_n)\\}$，见 [[67-df-arithmetical-classes]]。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"854772391cef4007","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$x,y$ 为互异变量，$\\gamma(x,y)\\in\\Gamma$，$\\mathrm{free}_{L_A}(\\gamma)\\subseteq\\{x,y\\}$；无捕获代入取 [[67-df-sentence]]。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-partially-conservative","status":"resolved","id":"5d04e3c8a5885c18","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ConsSent}$ 及 $\\mathrm{Conserv}$ 的方向采用 [[67-df-partially-conservative]]，$\\bar k,\\bar m$ 为标准数词，$k,m\\in\\mathbb N$。","embed":false},{"target":"67-thm-conservativity-compression","status":"resolved","id":"43165f8108fcba25","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"对应印刷66页/PDF77页定理4(b)，与已有仅压缩一个给定 r.e. 句集的 [[67-thm-conservativity-compression]] 区分。这里存在同一个公式 $\\eta(x)$ 同时处理所有行参数 $k$；不是每个 $k$ 各自选择一句之后未证明选择可统一。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"n\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"(\\Gamma,\\Gamma^{\\mathrm d})\\in\\{(\\Sigma_n,\\Pi_n),(\\Pi_n,\\Sigma_n)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"x,y","display":false},{"tex":"\\gamma(x,y)\\in\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{free}_{L_A}(\\gamma)\\subseteq\\{x,y\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ConsSent}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Conserv}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar k,\\bar m","display":false},{"tex":"k,m\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists\\eta\\in\\Gamma\\;\\left(\\mathrm{free}_{L_A}(\\eta)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\mathrm{Conserv}_{\\Gamma^{\\mathrm d}}\\left(T\\cup\\{\\eta[\\bar k/x]\\},T\\cup\\{\\gamma[\\bar k/x,\\bar m/y]:m\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\right)\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\eta(x)","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false}],"bytes":2210,"backlinks":[{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"ref-179","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-thm-uniform-conservativity-compression]]"},{"id":"161ada0e6be38670","anchor":"ref-37","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-partially-conservative]]；[[../67-thm-partial-conservativity]]；[[../67-thm-negated-consistency-conservative]]；[[../67-thm-bilateral-conservativity]]；[[../67-thm-uniform-conservativity-compression]]；[[../67-lem-pi-conservative-splitting]]；[[../67-thm-pi-conservativity-disjunction]]；[[../67-thm-sigma-conservativity-separation]]；[[../67-cor-sigma-no-delta-separator]]"}],"outgoing":["